[32;1m[1;3mQuestion: A precision manufacturing facility produces Widget1 through Widget141. The product_resources.csv file details, for each widget, the labor hours per unit, Material A per unit, Material B per unit, and base profit per unit sold. Widget3 generates CatalystX as a byproduct at 5 kg per unit produced. CatalystX can be sold at $300/kg, up to 1500 kg/month; unsold CatalystX must be disposed of at $200/kg. Resource_limits.csv gives: labor ≤ 5000 hours, Material A ≤ 24000 kg, Material B ≤ 15000 kg. Determine the optimal production quantities for each widget and CatalystX sales to maximize total profit.

